&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 5pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;The following table shows our short-term borrowings and their corresponding weighted-average interest rates:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
