&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;Substantially all materials and supplies, fossil fuel, and natural gas in storage inventories are recorded using the weighted-average cost method of accounting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri; font-weight: bold;"&gt;NOTE 11&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri; font-weight: bold;"&gt; - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri; font-weight: bold;"&gt;INCOME TAXES&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
