&lt;p style="margin-top: 3.75pt; margin-bottom: 1.5pt; font-size: 9pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;Reserves for future environmental remediation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
