    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHD2C7E83A687FC6145C3ED8F7D22FC54D" xlink:to="HH6354D0D2D4BCB4C9AA91C59BF848D588" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH19C103B226670894E5680082687A7BFB" xlink:label="HH19C103B226670894E5680082687A7BFB" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHCFBD78188E150BF7A94A71E7A3D7794A" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>332 L1a</p>
        <p>Network transmission is billed by ATC (billing agent), but it is reported under MISO since MISO is the transmission provider; ATC acts as the billing agent in order to facilitate the billing process.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH19C103B226670894E5680082687A7BFB" xlink:to="HHCFBD78188E150BF7A94A71E7A3D7794A" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HHD832F9E3B00031C401EC37404F882EF5" xlink:label="HHD832F9E3B00031C401EC37404F882EF5" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH464575E32845B388A32A8958AB534935" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>332 L1g</p>
        <p>Other charges consist of Schedule 26 (Network Upgrade), Schedule 26A (Multi-Value Project Cost Recovery), Schedule 26D (Cost Recovery for Targeted Market Efficiency Projhects-PJM), Schedule 26E (Cost Recover for Interregional Market Efficiency Projects), Schedule 33 (Blackstart Service), Unreserved Use Revenue.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHD832F9E3B00031C401EC37404F882EF5" xlink:to="HH464575E32845B388A32A8958AB534935" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH1DEFEE87FDD1B7DD3419099F39329010" xlink:label="HH1DEFEE87FDD1B7DD3419099F39329010" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH623F295E69345646AA7539D0ED73A429" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>332 2g</p>
        <p>Other charges consist of amounts for amortization of Regulatory Assets and Regulatory Liability dollars per the PSCW Rate Order.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH1DEFEE87FDD1B7DD3419099F39329010" xlink:to="HH623F295E69345646AA7539D0ED73A429" order="1" />
